
### 1. Get Current Inventory
GET http://localhost:8080/api/v1/inventory/1


### 2. Receive 100 Units
POST http://localhost:8080/api/v1/stock-movements
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "inventoryId": 1,
  "movementType": "RECEIVE",
  "quantity": 100,
  "referenceNumber": "PO-1001",
  "reason": "Supplier delivery"
}


### 3. Record Sale of 20 Units
POST http://localhost:8080/api/v1/stock-movements
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "inventoryId": 1,
  "movementType": "SALE",
  "quantity": 20,
  "referenceNumber": "SALE-1001",
  "reason": "Customer purchases"
}


### 4. Record 3 Damaged Units
POST http://localhost:8080/api/v1/stock-movements
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "inventoryId": 1,
  "movementType": "DAMAGE",
  "quantity": 3,
  "referenceNumber": "DMG-1001",
  "reason": "Damaged during handling"
}


### 5. Customer Returns 5 Units
POST http://localhost:8080/api/v1/stock-movements
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "inventoryId": 1,
  "movementType": "RETURN",
  "quantity": 5,
  "referenceNumber": "RET-1001",
  "reason": "Customer return, item resellable"
}


### 6. Positive Stock Adjustment
POST http://localhost:8080/api/v1/stock-movements
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "inventoryId": 1,
  "movementType": "ADJUSTMENT",
  "quantity": 10,
  "referenceNumber": "ADJ-1001",
  "reason": "Physical stock count correction"
}


### 7. Negative Stock Adjustment
POST http://localhost:8080/api/v1/stock-movements
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "inventoryId": 1,
  "movementType": "ADJUSTMENT",
  "quantity": -2,
  "referenceNumber": "ADJ-1002",
  "reason": "Physical stock count correction"
}


### 8. Get Stock Movement History
GET http://localhost:8080/api/v1/stock-movements/inventory/1


### 9. Get Movement by ID
GET http://localhost:8080/api/v1/stock-movements/1


### 10. Verify Updated Inventory
GET http://localhost:8080/api/v1/inventory/1


### 11. Invalid Quantity Test - Expect 400
POST http://localhost:8080/api/v1/stock-movements
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "inventoryId": 1,
  "movementType": "RECEIVE",
  "quantity": -10,
  "referenceNumber": "INVALID-1001",
  "reason": "Negative receiving test"
}


### 12. Insufficient Stock Test - Expect 400
POST http://localhost:8080/api/v1/stock-movements
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "inventoryId": 1,
  "movementType": "SALE",
  "quantity": 999999,
  "referenceNumber": "INVALID-1002",
  "reason": "Insufficient stock test"
}


### 13. Unknown Inventory - Expect 404
POST http://localhost:8080/api/v1/stock-movements
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "inventoryId": 999999,
  "movementType": "RECEIVE",
  "quantity": 10,
  "referenceNumber": "INVALID-1003",
  "reason": "Unknown inventory test"
}
